CcipBridge virtual _transportSend munge (verification-only)
============================================================

Makes CcipBridge._transportSend `virtual` so the Certora harness
(certora/harnesses/CcipBridge.sol) can override it to record a Solidity-side
keccak256 digest of every sent payload (`sentPayloadDigest`). Mutation testing
showed CVL-side keccak256 equality over cross-boundary dynamic bytes is
content-blind at payload sizes, so the BRIDGE-01 payload-fidelity asserts must
compare EVM-side digests instead of gCcipDataHash ghosts.

Semantics are unchanged: no production contract overrides _transportSend.

Apply:  git apply certora/patches/CcipBridge_virtualTransportSend.patch
Revert: git apply -R certora/patches/CcipBridge_virtualTransportSend.patch

Never commit the applied state to src/.

diff --git a/src/bridge/CcipBridge.sol b/src/bridge/CcipBridge.sol
index 9771e03..aeb9bf6 100644
--- a/src/bridge/CcipBridge.sol
+++ b/src/bridge/CcipBridge.sol
@@ -169,6 +169,7 @@ contract CcipBridge is CCIPReceiver, UUPSUpgradeable, Initializable, OwnableRole
     /// @return messageId The CCIP message identifier returned by the router.
     function _transportSend(uint256 _dstChain, bytes memory _payload, bytes calldata _options)
         internal
+        virtual
         override
         returns (bytes32 messageId)
     {
